Package: watermark
Type: Package
Title: Embed Traceable Watermarks in ggplot2 Visualizations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Jane", "Doe",
      email = "jane@example.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Embeds invisible watermarks into ggplot2 plots using LSB steganography.
    The watermark is hidden in the least significant bits of pixel data, making
    the watermarked image visually identical to the original (max 1 RGB value difference).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.0.0)
Suggests:
    png
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
